1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:04,230
(Priya:)It means I-I work late.

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:06,300
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Please tell me
you're not dating an American.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,930
(Mrs Koothrappali:)I knew this would happen.

4
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:09,600
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Rajesh, are you
letting your sister

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,300
(Mrs Koothrappali:)date that little Howard boy?

6
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:15,370
(Dr Koothrappali:)Now, hold on. If she
is dating an American,

7
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:16,370
(Dr Koothrappali:)that's not a bad way to go.

8
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,340
(Dr Koothrappali:)He's Jewish.

9
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:19,280
(Dr Koothrappali:)Those chaps are
very successful,

10
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,280
(Dr Koothrappali:)and they don't drink a lot.

11
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,750
It-It doesn't matter.
Howard has a girlfriend.

12
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,250
(Priya:)For now.
What does that mean?

13
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:26,450
(Priya:)I'll tell you later.

14
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,520
(Raj:)Is something going on
with him and Bernadette?

15
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:30,720
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Who's Bernadette?
Doesn't sound Jewish.

16
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,690
(Mrs Koothrappali:)You can't tell by that.

17
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:36,330
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Winona Ryder is Jewish.

18
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:38,360
(Dr Koothrappali:)Okay, we're getting
off the subject.

19
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,130
(Dr Koothrappali:)Rajesh, I want
you to try harder

20
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:41,700
(Dr Koothrappali:)to make your sister
feel welcome.

21
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:43,270
(Priya:)Thank you, Daddy.

22
00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:44,970
(Raj:)Don't worry. Everything I have,
I share with her.

23
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:46,800
(Raj:)Including my friend Leon...

24
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:50,040
(Priya:)Good night, Mummy.
Good night, Daddy.

25
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:54,580
(Raj:)Oh, my God,
I think you broke my toe!

26
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:56,810
(Priya:)You should have kept
your mouth shut.

27
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,720
(Raj:)Fair enough.

28
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:05,020
(Raj:)Now, what's up with Clarinet...?
Bernadette!

